{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1273,
  "batch_count": 1701,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "624b11ee6bac4894f9e1bac15c5037fc7d787286",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76ac74afcb991f638dde6dab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的我充满干劲。\r\n看来能跑出不辱「皇帝」名号的成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f275abae1174ec20a3e97efb1967473d0dca45b09893fe51a3ce1c0ea319d007",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87d8cd8369262cff0a803a77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态「非常好」。\r\n那我们也「非常豪」迈地去训练吧！\r\n……呵呵，连冷笑话都特别有灵感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2764ee4932b8c164cae857003ccb820c89c806f1fe965c3ab87fcaf42970a694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a5bf20e509670353dd7502f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「以顶点为目标」\r\n这个目标会使我更加有动力奋斗。\r\n今天也要好好训练来精进自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fd6d8f15cea5fa59d79a2395e7fcca52f33f6202ce957ab074b382bb82d1690",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aff2acbf4206152684dc65da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要想着赛马娘们的事情，\r\n很自然地就会充满干劲。\r\n我必须朝着志向继续迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4688711391f49de72f5068d97884a1e001591ba964760739418ea9771d708d3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17d859c5d7b6eb0ff1a146d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都已经准备好了，\r\n来开始训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87d6ba486eca403724d69f7bf3144072b7ba78884d1a50c4ce988c6c5b7170e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ca6a795940a63a4bfdf3d3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日积月累的努力必会成为\r\n朝目标迈进的能量。\r\n今天也要努力进行训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35e24c3e720a93ef226ec73ba5c4c69c89518a943267a66c5a64064212f3dfa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4908fc1b7895dbef253a8f79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……状态一直不太好，\r\n但也不能因为这种小事而埋怨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc280c973256d4c551c01341c81928b990ef05e9093c96c067b4a6f050df2cf1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9d5b85f34e1bf1c6795a393",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的集中力不太好。\r\n没事的……就算是这样，\r\n该做的事情我还是会做好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2511e66fc3d95c4e8e6b34743d8b84d6e3d9398a28cd2e1154e771a0770ff162",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5abcd0e918d631a32fcf12c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "糟糕……感觉身体很沉重。\r\n但我不想浪费任何一天……",
      "source_fingerprint": "02dc93ee185d35f5581643df2dd3ad7bccf18b94a1d837d0c0892f85dfe28eb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ede1c5377e3ffe2b1d3270d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没办法发挥平时的水平……\r\n虽然我知道不该是这样的表现……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d318e2f97503e3d6ac99dfcfcb36ccd18adc6b7b0384f89885d7809087241a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f36c780581be8e6648bc0edc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近一直连续在比赛……\r\n没事，我会尽我所能的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d68417be66d17e531f01d3cc884484609a65a546a36a0d155deffee03edce56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73961e138dc75573d5044b0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会拼命去做……\r\n但这样的努力不一定能达到\r\n预期的成果，希望你能有所觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0244bd509396a961aa0162ddb9e8bf2caca4bd283d2427a62bfaee18551e348b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d62bcd8d913bccf07701e825",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉有股力量从体内涌出。\r\n我会威风凛凛地跑赢这场比赛的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4932e236bfe42a11ee9f5dabb6767d0f536631bab264aa340d8fc8c4e2d6f050",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02b4ccffb4f95fc8f2b04adb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽说比赛是没有「绝对」的，\r\n但现在的我应该能让你看见……\r\n「绝对」的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "550b65f3808918ee6288012a25d9edc7c213dc0b07a937e56775736999121675",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07fa871a2818660c671a0b4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，很庆幸能在如此\r\n情绪高昂的状态下参赛。\r\n现在就已经等不及要开跑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae7e996cc54fe7c9e19c61cd08302487eeb620b3645465ff0b9b44b94acbdb88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9d18594f3e50a4f2c209457",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在能像这样以理想的状态参赛，\r\n都归功于训练员的手腕。\r\n我会用结果来回报你的努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "364c0e81f9c6e6d3ac2730c7c47be052a8854100eaf949b08bc7603adc874a40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc84eeabce21d43f4f0ae7c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心，\r\n今天是超越平时的绝佳状态。\r\n感觉能跑出好成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9657544296c2081992340a4755e63b36cbc8269125640fa903f45ba397e9d4de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd3d3b32f45a69e63d0f2357",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，心里充满了期待。\r\n看来是能带好消息回来给你了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb36d7114161dbb17c9abd09a93b840b217298d2c74e2fd221050b0861878414",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cb3b2edc6c40a3718bc078e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使被誉为「皇帝」也不能骄傲，\r\n必须专心迎战眼前的比赛……\r\n我会用尽全力去跑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89bf40b1169282ce69b28739efc378c42b17998a8b6f1c98d221cca49acfe302",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:738db21ffc0b74aed132940e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情十分平静，\r\n剩下的就只是上场用尽全力奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83149f255a54735ec54c5dd47e7850e18e64a15a178db0eb2056bbcd7e6fd8fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1f07c1d248cc90d7af464d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛的时间到了，\r\n走吧，训练员君。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fae1c0b7252761dada911d6aef571da3569ca9e3c8e8953f5405c5488226d26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f31b7c8bd233c3b6e4496d3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然状态没那么理想……\r\n没事，我很清楚自己该做些什么。\r\n总之全力以赴吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34fbe7cbc26a4959f95dabb361b54ea2fff1fee1363b90c7950738d5e5f18f87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ef0dac4609623550be1f7c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽称不上是万全的状态，\r\n但不能因此退缩。\r\n我会保持坚毅的心态出赛的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6779583613f23274e6d56d256a012bb6cae477453b23a8680d6cfa9da87223b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c02e65d9ca5238a0b709097",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会带着自信去跑的。\r\n就算状态不好，我也依然是\r\n背负了「皇帝」名号的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8345cd757e3f175ffe5c0361c3ff071d989c6b899cc4ae03171aece51bd225ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06c6f65e9f744f1fe12a965f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态没有调整好……\r\n但我不会因此放弃比赛。\r\n我会尽我所能全力以赴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f573f4c5c9300fc26137f1e18cf578b3363bd308bd4e02f435770f89e3615d9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de849b5992853d665ae20f8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没想到竟然会在比赛前受到影响……\r\n我会虚心接受这次的教训，\r\n尽力跑完比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "675ee12f6e5ac9f639cbaa9e6ffd3a7a3a0cf70e77e8dc175b0340f4e562d85e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22c0b6a87b2fd82f7c8aa1b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态不好是我自己的责任……\r\n我会抱着粉身碎骨的觉悟去迎战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bb5350ddb93b1bb46227ef41b5766ce636ef4c87b12453ec628c949da08935d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddd031ff04972b4afafff822",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c5d396881b1268faf7186fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明白了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a2d68c4ff9cf3599c629adf9fd7b4ee5f4b10e6408f421a524401a5087b17b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4353ba071f10ede0d5a0ee3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "相信我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0676de27273bf73845419fa98e3de6bc5f7b61899b561af3a80b660b380fe3ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3e9e08844c724771f9254ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4751dd24b1cc01c018d0bfc5e41666107f225b47c76b137af696c4a8217995a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8183581edfc140729bcd1e65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a4e1df408b325e7498dd0dbd16dfa65e96cd654a4bab6bba7b78f0a47f36a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:366a993f1df39cc5be8f216d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a977ca8e3137e67a7a6918a06d3d86d57fbf577994f726c5155115e0a2b3071a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f35076bb6069b6648d9f3cad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我上场了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60aa19fb3dd8d6ae2ee3947ac73df9b63f1f36247a2a9557a12d92df25acab89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cde769bd02518321d04e1051",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb68552f124570bd5245c78bdd75a028b4df21ce5b7bd41549967729dbf58354",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6a7d6ea0398b2af6f21bb59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是不是离志向更近了一点呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7038aefb8a1b68b77d79503f119f4c96a20858a51f23b3af474c9e62610da00f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e26069473514fee23ca826ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，训练员君。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9af3af62964dff2d2a52e2d154d5948ec8553f2125507d64cdb6fa018e54727",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c47681165d40aa55e2f3cecb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起精进吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5522e74daf1b1511624b901c255b6a0b98079e56084182b48693c25ab8d7ca1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fef6197c2c75d6ae7761031",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们团结一致地去完成吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "978b5bb93c2a978f8835c9b34e3e1982c43215d7fbe5693e8c9129031bd0ebf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6fc39227994fdb922eb6e5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奋力一搏，打起精神上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd6027b99b7f877246512aa7b03b92a44c7990d01b0c1b739633afd56e6424fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c80a7c4736caf85e04bfef49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，训练员君。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9af3af62964dff2d2a52e2d154d5948ec8553f2125507d64cdb6fa018e54727",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db6f97355fa2764f532e47ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，心里充满了期待。\r\n看来是能带好消息回来给你了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb36d7114161dbb17c9abd09a93b840b217298d2c74e2fd221050b0861878414",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9280302aa411f6934faeb3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，很庆幸\r\n能在如此情绪高昂的状态下参赛。\r\n我现在就已经等不及要开跑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4a8c8309751d0d69d2c6db61b26980209a0e7e8800e5a470ddcd8193ec0389a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d3234ec36e61fe6f3235f16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，训练员君。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9af3af62964dff2d2a52e2d154d5948ec8553f2125507d64cdb6fa018e54727",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e6752f3df507ce915c0688f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48ee932f6ddb4701f0950747",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定要登上顶点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "725a9d43d20f3f5817f95f9fbc893e3e3e7ea7f59f42b9c1f2d73ec2b5eb25a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:069cbff469c91e1fe4ef9b35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，还可以的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0989b2e9eba1d8bdfd3cde2ada6aa04d78a34f5dc417a33b1a496e87c1c86351",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6daa1b298f157ca239ed4f5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还要朝更高的目标迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69373f017d95bbd0848d8a40bc7b5b930b51ffdeab95c43a8fcb80bb4a54f04a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dabea60daac49786ab76863",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会以这次的结果当作训诫的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4af68ea00f2631d8108b2750ffbf4704c0abce6e1bb4b170aedc97c1ff46fea4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e842531ec36e0afc3d9551b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「一骑绝尘无与齐驱」，没错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eb585e9ec2d2065f2fd6077e98c22196caf2ed1fb7c294490cb3b985b9dbcbf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6b0aabeef314540ebfeff34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到了吧──这就是「皇帝」的奔驰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d298c8ac34f4d3594b7fd78179a9faa962000fc5e6dba33654e29ebf86457f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8976585445889d5895687d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样算是击落目标的成果了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4da235bbc296d4c03a5488271448728ff542981ace3ab4e20d0be6ec80d3f7e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad63a3aa67a3fbc40fb16408",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到了吧──这就是「皇帝」的奔驰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d298c8ac34f4d3594b7fd78179a9faa962000fc5e6dba33654e29ebf86457f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cabdebab1cccb905bdc588d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "率领黑暗，继续前进吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c83b960ff4df88b4971c86afda72e4269a15aa1947f780c7fb56efcf37ef5880",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be60f7055177383c17f8992f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到了吗――这就是“皇帝”的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af59ddbce9e5fc85e00f76b7baa27e6adcd59392aaef7e4c799abfbb7d11cdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8287fe95b3831e5c3349cf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再次书写历史吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c06535ba8f595015de8cdf51140a79bbfce36da1c7947bb98bf563d4d5b21dae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7a2b8bc921afeb11e389597",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "响彻吧──天下无双的嘶吼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "130c5445f5d662621d7c6798d2d4239a848c89bd81df82d1f45f281131df07ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7691bab7a0d51b670a7a7aa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也还不够成熟。集中精神，整理\r\n文件吧。联系气槽\r\n……不，稍后再向她报告吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d1e9f7078c8df5231202ba7de0b71ec94123f252202a0d81819990911be0fa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c63ae0e41a49844bac50b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该做的都已经做了。\r\n之后就只能……拭目以待了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb3ff53474595ad1c8dcaa021e81973a407b3592b462cf22d3cd7d67ff4abfd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67677f5bc7637587517a83d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "伴随着漫天飞雪，地上的\r\n雪之花似乎也悄然绽放了呢。\r\n那是举世罕见又美丽绝伦的花朵啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e67f76b07746f87cf9873320cd5796a3071cbedb1f254cc9ce8a9d3c6163569b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c79946b10db36007119d0058",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多到了野兽苏醒的时候了。\r\n……等你很久了喔，白仁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4681a8388717af0f2b8f307502f8f9b920291f11f2ed0df386a031c550b028a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:336549f5fd5ea1d0d7207586",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勤勉精进。我们共同打造出了\r\n出色的祭典呢……那么，接下来\r\n只剩解决那些积着的会长工作了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7847083976602bae12451b5d8674a9578ff3754ec36a4a13f4985cd13d3d33a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e89be766952c4ed3ef855826",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前方若无路可行，那么……就更该勇往直前！\r\n走出自己的路……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78977ea3f27c392e1f0300c5d489bebef74b58e2f06a2bda16fd9f61c7be555b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7038b0309675b8e589e28888",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是惊心动魄、精彩绝伦的活跃表现啊，\r\n“女帝”……我也得对自己进行一番淬炼了，\r\n为了下次能够彻底压制住你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0a6c922f852304e876a84225cb3aebd61b5d9de3381b787f605323554aa880c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5da4aea45c805781db98756c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务在这里。\r\n正所谓滴水穿石。哪怕力量\r\n十分渺小，也要努力不懈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a390d2b241a93d46ff168bd91ad63f91f8baaae1a960e50bba688a40e60fd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e88b1ec3a73bbc2b453d857f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有忘了收下报酬吧？正所谓\r\n慎始敬终。自始至终都要谨慎，\r\n在最后划下完美的句号。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd0a30f5553430a67cc5efa91f9679f0e193a71ee47b959f608c06bc63bbe2b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06ffecd53f9da89a5258852a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候，与你共舞主要是为了\r\n教导你……但总有一天，\r\n希望能在演唱会上与你一较高下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "daadf031b2c155dc087909377d183e9a7a4e7b682e7889e2a11cdf582f350e9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e2874b2140642e1e3ef33d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用我的弓箭祛除灾厄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "890c4e858471d9fd3cd71c90698e3bf23bd213abb19edf678975ec7ecbe69494",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ff47a63b3f12d4e734febe1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好瞄准，就能清楚看见目标。\r\n一、二。然后就这样……！\r\n……结束了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd4fb99831d54be410dbd8b8cc1ec7c3f7c9465cc54be22c4ef37cf6b7130cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16c766ca0208a0f5e7fc370b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "势在必行了啊。\r\n那么剩下的就是尽力做好\r\n一本优秀的导览手册了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71af5dac158c10368a539efa6ebb02c4342d817b7fb9ec3ffb3466e8b1514937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05e1fb5c9d97571591549efa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们的目标，是带来一场展现赛马娘\r\n炽热志向的表演。不必担心，\r\n这次我可没有加任何冷笑话进去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63155f6a56425c55ae9c6c684a1204254481f01e200c775d554045667616faf8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400094"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e578432c4b369e1049d1a84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽有着深受后辈爱慕与信赖的、\r\n令人叹服的包容力啊……\r\n关于这一点，我实在不得不由衷感佩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4edff97d102f970d107f6c42580d097a7699ca5bba28a2c9c1e707bd2cf47d93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400142"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09a5943d59c207ffc3ebe30b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看见了――一线光明！",
      "source_fingerprint": "813bdf99934002a6b2e9936406bf6b0cd483933e4bf6ad0935812b238eb271ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02d9ab491f99da0ea6c756f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使永夜，也能成为幸福世界的基石。\r\n背负漆黑羽翼，前进吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d5d1f4c0550b32b723b9897a8874c4d9754f59ba5c9fc8ea78f08681deb66bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47c9543dc8058d117fa141a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "167c476ae4e50740d222867d26ce1988fafb946c30ad3f608beb919ca0d564f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56f08fb43eb000a616d686a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8eae5c19de1a418e1c2117f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "533af1ec55aaabd2fb64979f1b375b53b2aa3d91c5132bfaaf1eceef39f399ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a25453ef9befd79bab36c16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "533af1ec55aaabd2fb64979f1b375b53b2aa3d91c5132bfaaf1eceef39f399ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:158c680f70e8678ecfc592d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae0d1ca7000d0a1d6996e337c00c38005469ade66f4e595e4b21b05e784807e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b7786711419b8d7b850745b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae0d1ca7000d0a1d6996e337c00c38005469ade66f4e595e4b21b05e784807e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
